  "description": "In a web of secrets and danger, Eugene, a young woman posing as Derick's male secretary, hides from a tragic and dangerous past. But when a lethal assassin targets Eugene, and other sketchy figures target Derick for his riches, their world crumbles. Bound by a secret, passionate love and a shared history, their fight for survival intensifies as peril looms ever closer. Unfortunately, Derick's ability to guard Eugene continues to slip. Soon, they will have to confront an agonizing question... What does it mean to truly protect the one you love most? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
